OL,3,ARosalia scoops historic third best
OL,4,Aalbum award at Latin Grammys
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosalia released Lux last year to rave
OL,7,Freviews and collecting her award at the
OL,8,Fceremony in Las Vegas on Thursday, she
OL,9,Fsaid: "To all the people who told me I
OL,10,Fwasn't good enough, or that my music
OL,11,Fwas too weird, I'm thankful I didn't
OL,12,Flisten."
